@startuml
title View command — high-level component interaction
hide footbox
autonumber

actor User
participant UI
participant Logic
participant Model
participant Storage

User -> UI: Enter `view` command
activate UI
UI -> Logic: Execute command
activate Logic
Logic -> Model: Read student data
activate Model
Model --> Logic: Student data
deactivate Model
alt No field specified
    Logic -> Model: Update visible student list
    activate Model
    Model --> Logic: List updated
    deactivate Model
else Field specified
    Logic -> Model: Get values for selected field
    activate Model
    Model --> Logic: Student data
    deactivate Model
    Logic -> Logic: Count distinct values
end
Logic -> Storage: Save address book
activate Storage
Storage --> Logic: Save complete
deactivate Storage
Logic --> UI: Return command result
deactivate Logic
UI --> User: Display result
deactivate UI

@enduml
